  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who engage with online memes and may be exposed to or share racially charged content, particularly those who might be unaware of or indifferent to the hateful implications of the racial slur and the anti-Black primate stereotype used in the meme. The meme is designed to provoke, insult, and spread hate specifically targeting Black people, so the target audience is likely those who are either unaware of the racial implications or who are part of a community that tolerates or perpetuates such hate speech.",
